      "instance_name": "person",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The meme is designed for an audience familiar with the wordplay between 'rocks' (as in skipping rocks) and 'rocks' (as in marijuana). The target audience likely includes individuals who understand drug culture slang, appreciate pun-based humor, and are comfortable with casual or sarcastic commentary on recreational drug use. The audience is probably adults or older teens who recognize the absurdity of the situation and the cultural reference to marijuana, and who find the juxtaposition of innocent rock skipping with drug smoking humorous or ironic.",
